Description: Reproducible pipeline that regenerates every figure and table for
    the OmniPath Metabo manuscript (main text and supplementary) from a
    pinned OmniPath Postgres snapshot. Plots are ggplot2 + tidyverse; the
    Figure 1A workflow-architecture diagram is a manual Inkscape asset
    vendored under inst/extdata/manual/architecture/ (fingerprint-verified
    on every rebuild); composites are assembled automatically via
    patchwork, LaTeX pdfpages, svgutils, and pdftk. See
    specs/001-figures-pipeline/ in the saezverse repository for the spec,
    plan, contracts, and quickstart.
